    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi na Mefi-boshesi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya yenīyī ū Daūdi ūbūūja, “Ataalī alīho munhū ose ose wa mu numba ya ng'wa Saulo nang'wītīle yawiza kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Yonasani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo walīho ntūmami wa ha kaya ya ng'wa Saulo witanagwa ī lina lyakwe Ziba. Būng'witana wiza ū kūlī Daūdi; ū ntemi ūmūja, “Ū bebe hū ūlī Ziba?” Nang'hwe ūshosha, “Hū ng'wene ū ntūmami wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūmūja, “Atīho munhū ose ose wa mu kaya ya ng'wa Saulo nang'olekeje wiza bo ng'wa Mulungu?” Ū Ziba ūnshokeja ū ntemi ūhaya, “Alīho ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yonasani alemehalile a magūlū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūbūūja, “Alī halī?” Ū Ziba ūshosha ūhaya, “Alī Lodebaali ha ng'wa Makili, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Amieli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūlagīja ūīlwa ko ī Lodebaali, ū kū ng'wa Makili ng'witūnja o ng'wa Amieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mefi-boshesi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yonasani ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Saulo, aho washika ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Daūdi, winama kūlwa koolekeja ikūjo. Ū Daūdi ūhaya, “Mefi-boshesi!” Nang'hwe widīka, “Hū nene ntūmami wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla, “Lekaga ū kogoha, nakūkwītīla yawiza kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa so ū Yonasani. Pye a malaale ayo gaalī ga ng'wa gūkūyo Saulo nakūkūshokeja, hama ū bebe ūkūyūlīīla ha meeza yane būlī lūshikū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mefi-boshesi winama, hūna ūshosha, “Ū ntūmami wako alī kī nang'hwe, nose ūlole na mvwa īchile gītī nene ūyū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūng'witana ū Ziba ū ntūmami wa ha kaya ya ng'wa Saulo ūng'wīla, “Ū ng'wizūkūlū o ng'wa so būgonzo nang'winhaga būlī shikolo īsho shalī sha ng'wa Saulo na kaya yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe na a bitūnja bako, hamò na a batūmami bako mukūyūnīmīla ī migūnda yakwe ng'wang'wenhela a matwajo, ū ng'wizūkūlū o ng'wa so būgonzo apandīke sha kwigunanhīla. Nīyo ū Mefi-boshesi ū ng'wizūkūlū o ng'wa so būgonzo akūyūlīīla ha meza yane būlī lūshikū.” (Ū Ziba walī na bitūnja ikūmi na batanò, na batūmami makūmi abīlī.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ziba ūshosha, “Ū nene ntūmami wako nakwīta būlī mhayo ūyo ūlanilagīje ū nene ntūmami wako baba ntemi.” Na lūūlū ū Mefi-boshesi ūyūlīīla ha meza ya ng'wa Daūdi gīt'ūmò wa bitūnja ba ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mefi-boshesi walī na ng'witūnja ataalī ndo; witanagwa Mika. A banhū ba mu kaya ya ng'wa Ziba a bose būbiza batūmami ba ng'wa Mefi-boshesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei ū Mefi-boshesi ūbiza ng'wikaji wa mu Yelusalemu nguno būlī lūshikū walīīlaga ha meeza ya ntemi; walī alemehalile a magūlū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
